      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Proponents argue that real-time analysis of a live feed significantly elevates the capability beyond traditional, passive camera surveillance.\n\nWhereas standard cameras are purely *after-the-fact* evidence, a powerful AI system can *proactively flag* suspicious behavior or pre-determined \"watch list\" individuals the very moment they step into the station. This immediate, targeted alert to security personnel allows for a direct and swift intervention before a crime can escalate, making the difference a highly targeted and immediate threat response, not just a better after-the-fact review.",
      "source": "target",
